    "shape": "restaurants.operating_hours: {mon..sun: [{open:'HH:MM', close:'HH:MM'}]} — all seven keys required; [] = closed that day; up to 3 ranges per day; close <= open means the range crosses midnight into the next local day; interpreted in restaurants.timezone (IANA)",
